nulated [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n* ¼ [[Cookbook:Pound|pound]] dried [[Cookbook:Currant|currants]]\n* ¼ tsp [[Cookbook:Nutmeg|mace]]\n* Zest of half a [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemon]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]], well beaten\n* Candied cherries\n\n==Procedure==\n# Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to 350°F.\n# [[Cookbook:Sifting|Sift]] flour, salt, and baking powder; rub in butter. Add sugar, currants, mace, and lemon zest. Stir in eggs.\n# Form into rough balls about 1 [[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] in diameter. If balls aren't holding together well, sprinkle with water. Garnish with ⅛ of a candied cherry.\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] for 9 minutes at 350°F. Cool.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for cookies]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cherry]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon zest]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Rock Cookies","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"4 cups flour","sourceText":"4 cups flour","amountText":"4 cups flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"½ tsp salt","sourceText":"½ tsp salt","amountText":"½ tsp salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 tsp baking powder","sourceText":"1 tsp baking powder","amountText":"1 tsp baking powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"¾ cup butter","sourceText":"¾ cup butter","amountText":"¾ cup butter","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 cup granulated sugar","sourceText":"1 cup granulated sugar","amountText":"1 cup granulated sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"¼ pound dried currants","sourceText":"¼ pound dried currants","amountText":"¼ pound dried